      √ PROCEED_WITH_WARNING maps to WARNING_OVERRIDE with override logged badge
      √ Legacy ACCEPT maps neutrally to CUSTOM_OR_UNSUPPORTED requiring review (not green formal acceptance)
      √ Unsupported or custom decision maps to CUSTOM_OR_UNSUPPORTED without approval default (1 ms)
      √ Missing or null disposition returns null
    3. BatchInspectionModal Component SSR Rendering & State Assertions
      √ Initial SSR state without injected batch renders modal container, header, and audit footer (1 ms)
      √ BatchInspectionModal with initialBatch renders prominent banner, blank Not recorded, and read-only card while suppressing editable form (35 ms)

